{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_06_015_22_5_06_015_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:bc5e20c9721d61ca574d1180168714cff55a9c749d7023c57d8599467bf5765b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_06_015_22_5_06_015_22:5_06_015_22:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a62f0919262be5ac87fb4d0ec7859dbe3e88e597572b027613c35cd58a32d397",
      "text": "彩排也要全力以赴！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_015_22_5_06_015_22:5_06_015_22:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:128b3bb9304447098f1b4bbc1bb56cf707060803dc9a098e2b19247715e7282b",
      "text": "为庆祝315 Production的纪念日，\n决定举办特别演唱会。\n为了打造充满PASSION的最棒舞台，\n偶像们齐心协力制作新曲、服装以及舞台演出。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_015_22_5_06_015_22:5_06_015_22:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:598668baf1875ec5fdcbfe77dfe3393313f3d636d70888a5fb813a961ada4cf7",
      "text": "彩排结～束！好开心啊～！\n接下来只要在正式开演时帅气收尾就好啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_015_22_5_06_015_22:5_06_015_22:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:542b516f062e3014799e01a630e44ec4942391c3efdb80674f8d797ae3437c4d",
      "text": "我也超开心的！请人帮我们拍了\n彩排的视频，回酒店后一起看看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_015_22_5_06_015_22:5_06_015_22:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79b64a6b52279cc7203643fd6ad0fb3783ad945e0b7384cdaf46855661467baf",
      "text": "好呀，看、必须看！\n我有挺在意的地方呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_015_22_5_06_015_22:5_06_015_22:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a67e251194381c72919f53a223613b57ec045ddfd707ebd917fabd5549970e6",
      "text": "是悠介做了和平时有点不一样的动作的地方吧？\n你这家伙什么都没说就擅自发挥了呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_015_22_5_06_015_22:5_06_015_22:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:217cd7dbfdd33c4af6196dd00fec85391ffbd00eaaee538881149eb4920becfa",
      "text": "我不是故意的啦！看着Jupiter彩排，\n不由得热血沸腾，动作就做夸张了嘛～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_015_22_5_06_015_22:5_06_015_22:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e932ed34dbd5731d98b39744581c3dc1b359f82411b247932fbf05fbf5d794d8",
      "text": "不过那样气氛更热烈，而且就算我不说，\n享介不也好好配合上来了嘛？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_015_22_5_06_015_22:5_06_015_22:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:250f0a509b3bdcbe1a23773052bc1ecbf2fd5fa1bb6d2c6f85c4ee8278ab05c5",
      "text": "那不是理所当然的嘛？悠介脑子里在想什么，\n我可是一清二楚啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_015_22_5_06_015_22:5_06_015_22:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:636c8d0109816731c4a2dd2f8d9742483fd3f68b5197560442c6eb28a7bd43fd",
      "text": "嘛，我觉得那个动作挺帅的就是了。既然要做，\n好好商量一下把气氛彻底搞热吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_015_22_5_06_015_22:5_06_015_22:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0606ba82c28c9fd07220e7f6ffeb8f2004baf87dd48e4d464d471630b6d8e65f",
      "text": "嗯，就这么办就这么办！\n我现在已经等不及正式开演啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_015_22_5_06_015_22:5_06_015_22:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69e33d723402c10e2c3a06269144f942a6d1d0bb5746106c897ffbfdc7c9dcf3",
      "text": "我也是。在正式开演时，也要用我们的默契配合，\n展现最强的表演给他们看！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
